  "result": "This confirms `isDue()` in scheduler.ts governs generic job cadence (whether the tick runs jobs at all), not per-org eligibility — that per-org decision is `shouldRunForOrg()` in `digest-email-job.ts`. And the recipient decision is actually implemented in `notification-preference-repository.ts` (`listDigestSubscribers`), not in `digest-service.ts` which just delegates to it.\n\nSo the two source files that hold the actual decisions are:\n- **`src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts`** — `shouldRunForOrg()` decides which orgs are due at the current tick (not archived, and `now.getUTCHours() === org.settings.digestHourUtc`).\n- **`src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts`** — `listDigestSubscribers()` decides which people in the org are on the digest list (users with a `digestOnly` preference set to true).\n\nANSWER: src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts, src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts",
